sword logon attempts","54","Productive password not used for too long => no longer valid","60","SPNego logon deactivated","61","Invalid SPNego token (syntax)","62","NTLM token received instead of SPNego token","63","Missing/incorrect KeyTab entry","64","Expired SPNego token (time)","65","SPNego replay attack detected","66","Kerberos user name -> SNC name failed","67","SPNego: No SNC mapping found","68","SPNego: Multiple SNC mappings found","100","Client does not exist","101","Client is currently locked for logons (upgrade running)","999","Other error (see trace)","1002","Trusted system logon: Missing S_RFCACL authorization"]
